<Layout
  title={"Downward LUT6 Compilation in a Mixture of Limits Cascade"}
  description={"About: Downward LUT6 compilation in a four-rung Mixture of Limits cascade, Yosys/Verilator xck26 RTL simulation, Split-Conformal ACI gating, and AirMoL 4-bit NVMe streaming on 2026 hybrid models."}
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Research study · draft · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      Downward LUT6 Compilation in a Mixture of Limits Cascade
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      This study reports the public reference at openIE-dev/lut-adapt-ai (commit 0f2c85d). Backed by 27 Lean 4.36.0 machine-checked theorems (zero sorry), it places a reconfigurable 6-input truth-table (LUT6) lookup tier ahead of Mamba-3 and 4-bit NVMe-streamed late-2026 hybrid and sparse-MoE models up to 120B parameters (LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B, google/gemma-4-E2B-it, LiquidAI/LFM2.5-8B-A1B, Devstral-Small-2-24B-Instruct, Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B, and nvidia/Nemotron-3-Super-120B-A12B), gates commits behind deterministic verifiers, compiles certified wakes downward into clock-enable-gated 81-RAMB36E2 Beneš-routed lookup and canonical skill pages, and serves them over both Python and zero-Python single-binary Rust OpenAI /v1/chat/completions and Model Context Protocol (MCP) JSON-RPC 2.0 servers (mol-agent / mol-agent-rs).
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray mb-3">What the study claims and what it does not</p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        <li>Formal, software, Metal + Rust CubeCL shader, 120B, multi-repo SWE-bench, and reported_j results: 27 Lean 4.36.0 kernel-checked theorems (0 sorry, 0 custom axioms), Darwin F_NOCACHE os.pread NVMe byte counts, custom Apple Metal and portable Rust Burn 0.22.1 / CubeCL INT4 Sparse-MoE &amp; GatedDeltaNet compute shaders (holding Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B in 970.0 MB = 1.47% FP16 RAM at 6.773 J/tok dual-channel reported_j and 12.30× NVMe reduction at 100.0% exact token parity; 35.09× MoE and 69.20× DeltaNet CubeCL Metal speedups), measured 120B-scale nvidia/Nemotron-3-Super-120B-A12B execution on Apple M5 Max (58,075.4 MB resident Unified Memory at 22.17 tok/s; 62.50% verified pass vs. 43.75% standalone 120B-A12B with 0.00% broken commits), official BigCodeBench v0.1.3 (90.62% vs. 78.12% 35B; 93.75% Wave 2), 50.00% on single-repo SymPy SWE-bench Verified, 20.83% (2.50× standalone 24B/35B) across 4 upstream SWE-bench Verified repositories (django, pytest, requests, sympy; 24 evals) with 0.00% broken patches, and a zero-Python single-binary Rust mol-agent-rs server (0.154 ms/req MCP, 17.21× faster than Python; 35/35 pytest pass).</li>
        <li>RTL synthesis, CE-gated 4-stage 250 MHz pipelining, and VCD switching-activity audit: 41,185–41,623 xcup CLB LUTs in 1-cycle OOC and 41,465 CLB LUTs (35.40% of xck26) in the CE-gated 4-stage pipelined IOB-safe AXI4-Stream wrapper clai_benes_axi_stream_250mhz_top (reducing single-cycle logic depth 4.00× from 52 to 13 levels, fitting 170 &lt;= 189 IOBs, 81 RAMB36E2 blocks, 0 DSP48 slices, 320/320 CE parity, and 256/256 zero-bubble CPI = 1.00 Verilator parity), cutting AMD DS925 + Verilator VCD dynamic power 4.10× in quiescent idle (63.99 to 15.59 est_mW) and 2.69× during AXI4-Stream packet ingest (69.62 to 25.84 est_mW).</li>
        <li>Oracle-free wake gate: 0.00% false crystallization risk and 1.0000 OOD AUROC on the shifted test stream via a radially regularized JEPA-EBRM Split-Conformal + Adaptive Conformal Inference gate, keeping Conformal-bounded distinct from Deterministic.</li>
        <li>Not claimed: physical KV260 bitstream loading or isolated rail power in this repository (board_metered = false, measured_j = None; §4.22 and §4.25 switching figures are analytical est_j / est_mW excluding static leakage), commercial Vivado post-place-and-route 250 MHz timing closure, silicon energy leadership, or full 500-task SWE-bench Verified container evaluation beyond the 40 real upstream git-worktree evaluations across django, pytest, requests, and sympy.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <figure class="mt-10 glass-card p-4 fig-wide">
      <a class="fig-zoom" href="/figures/lut-adapt/mol-downward-cascade.svg" aria-label="Enlarge figure"><img src="/figures/lut-adapt/mol-downward-cascade.svg" alt="Four-rung Mixture of Limits cascade with downward SleepCrystallizer compilation into Beneš-routed LUT6 pages. Design diagram, not a power reading." class="fig-img w-full rounded bg-white" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></a>
